  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f1fc3785ca8aa7993cce95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想必她在下次的竞赛也会以精彩的表现让我们为之狂热吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4856596391c19da8a9e8099e593deba0043ba4671e4869c8b81920385288b0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd193f5aeb62530612138b10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在重要的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 一战中获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49191235593facbb36e0a6c8fcee7b8e2486d52e3d08164590c5b8eb78bd51d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07ea73f13c31c20d2c2df48d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在欢欣鼓舞的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中，由<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e32eacae674a03ad805b8c4f093315d251e40e5cc2f8eae7fff3c6b2ee4b4b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:217120aefa68af89bec9df0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，在大批观众注目下获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a745f3887d864aebbd193e5bb7b7c2a2169bdc270656bbaba9670e749c0b163c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7007f99a33af7244a03342",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以近期5战2胜的战绩获得注目的赛马娘果然实力坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f2fe9a1de71570090ce8660dd2ab9485c6c8c41cf7466e91592e79b4083f9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49692ae3a24bbfced9101abf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她不愧深具实力，即使与强敌并列也能有出类拔萃的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66935e8d4d0f29f9d2ac0f823dc84defae2bed4cf670baaf64dbe2fc7d6bafd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fec6396e6a7da1e8c3fca0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她展现了不论对手是谁、不论战场在何处都能发挥实力的稳定性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6434271ef7d1bfc6a838a2c7e995ec115b7881cde7a3e59e607c57968de6bcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79fbd7eb193e5deb20a3e8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够彻底在<bashin>的交战中胜出的实力无须质疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea88a7bfd997a96c49b66dddc8d6d1c585691267a9debe1e066cafd579d568f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b641a1cb45899c104463f092",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她在参赛者净是强豪的竞赛中，竟然以<bashin>胜出了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b940cb9503cb3e58f66ada4a317e1ce317249c100a389e7d5aa064f2fab95230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e4c6baad891a724c5de2c34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作为<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的王牌漂亮地打赢了一场硬仗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a68c044d528d572038f01a5df347ab086e9912fcdaea14f2ed039868026f8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a0bd668ea7708f942fa4d6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的领头之姿，从头到尾称霸竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a94b6407f63bbfe4db511b1ad8c9523b7652557609df960588c7ed1236f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3110b7ad86601161854b3077",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于前列以稳健的表现顺利地击败了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6813197caedf1ab36fb6fa4ad98f2eecefd47f4f5f2e41217898ee282f3bf29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ce93206bce8c19253c0626",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分发挥速度，以精彩的居中支配了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e160aa9cc09562fe9f1aacd9edd1ced625d25884c6e63e17f4e6786bf9a0820",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3f4db2b3b98a64a1ed0f25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以漂亮的后追，一个一个地超越了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e42e39105bf0d3ed3e523007703e09fe05d02600291575d2f943a40d039741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe918ea8746f712146069515",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望还能够持续看到如此精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caca7ce435219560096ccc9eba9ad08ed71e68ea3d673fa1076290f4882cd4ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2288745a658c41af19e5acc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "究竟能攀登至那里呢？让人无法移开视线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa46217a07ba803ba7c416628895157c1f849d9e3f93fed7c60b2d505b4a9780",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbda4f69f7e468d7a1b7ffe8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可不要错过这名赛马娘和大家约定好要获得的成功……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7968d0bc066587e16d4b103a8e2e64464ac2c368a72a351ed36b0b8628c1d140",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26310d01dd8a917c597f677d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "座无虚席的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛！<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>漂亮地摘下了胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93b0b0071b154f111adea3379842f6902a7615a7f25a6c8b570a8de155d34ab1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a52132263e408fed1f88291b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，逼退众多强者们取胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e76fd060913520c22e20983802c5011517fc8fd71d49c70a1644ae14dab9ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f92f45f1ab3f58f3f98c22a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！在高手云集的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中顺利拿下第1。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16bb3513f9e2f4386063faa01b4369f8f079f7e3db38d4b9243e5f3f15fb523b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e017bd0c8764e05e6f1394d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5战3胜的状态还不错，照这个气势下去也能称霸这场竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1320b0349e87523e009bef5db8e9c296940bc8d1ed29a8f00ee53aade11dbb2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bf39b745213633198c27981",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在本次大赛一帆风顺地一路胜出的赛马娘，让这场竞赛也十分精彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7188321109904a0eea7113fcc12ebc32d60e044cb176ce14ee8c63358def2073",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5239c41a21c4a5944d70ace",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便解说也只能想到赞美的话语，以完美表现拿下的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6ec596782905c1424b38b1732ca77ce69fe304c2b44631d211c91b5db56db46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ead81c7c95465d895c7eda1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "展现出了让人一看就明白为何会有如此高胜率的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e35614cfc343ebf5eb3c066acbadbf8919f1cbe29544f520f3208663d8300c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d895594d8aae74eec28ffcb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以<bashin>激烈地交战到现在，胜利已是垂手可得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b1d0bcfe763c861dfccd15061b7f9b9395413027342a38509a49a74b4d22bf1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143a8fc461dd4dec99f3773c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以<bashin>跑出无法想象她会输的完美胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bc6a6f94f5a8056541ba13ddc50a83ca50d7a9b522d313d944a412dbf0566cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e9115463feb731082216392",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的评价也扶摇直上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "843be21c5d61e9058ae85bbfe7f6d40dc0c736e2763f0d2d2f039dd23055bec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbb35e5433f5ea0985e162cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已经备受瞩目的她，究竟还会站上多高的地方呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed37972978e674b5b94b98fa43ecd1d9643e51e4efcd5b5c78becb93bd5a9ce8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e88f529088681b08eadd5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让人现在就开始期待她之后的参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8898c4689fe67a8d6347549858906341519ab6acbbd8e0846c3bb43e1138346a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67340496dd0ac22f32a18124",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被狂热席卷的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛。再度获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a03e550eaf3ce48ea2e065bc959c663fe82bf77b3f82e21f5c7972517cf4e06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8e41a0c1fa44ee3ef8917f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "撼动灵魂的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛！顺利获得了第1的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a727222463d6ed4ab74c005204dbe4cb315769f491ad41725d2dc96f748281",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87765d90f4f5599ca0b0884c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！在<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮以<bashin>胜出了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85f63e48ea5ee1f8bd64f33b55295f0953fb63ad3675deec5d9bcba446d5caeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad848b929a7caf1de41392dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5战4胜的状态绝佳，照这个气势下去也能彻底称霸这场竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec075d4d84780ac3217b8e5542d7dc215e50c33b260a31d30b29c66d3580e14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3992cf5aefe73d4a58f167b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "观众们沸腾的声援宛如地表轰隆作响，诉说着她的惊人表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed2563c8f7bcde39b4994c87fdfa8bc7fbeb7bd5016e5adaf152aea38659ab3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4630394e36d92d2f29bd6020",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她一路过关斩将，想来对手们也束手无策了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa57c4ec8848a5886e7806ed18c9e081628e05511d7ecd17741cbe0e1b220c8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3eb698b1536a8f4e357a40c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "展现出了让人一看就明白为何会有如此高胜率的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e35614cfc343ebf5eb3c066acbadbf8919f1cbe29544f520f3208663d8300c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa6593577704d216216881c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可别错过大赛中超级备受瞩目的选手接下来的竞赛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "443a9deef2b24e58b619f1bd384766bdcdcb39786c7f5ce7936efe55122cda1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd49e48e5d8f7196cca6451",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "甚至还听见说她会获胜简直是理所当然的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "857cd92fc2b453507e1d90b866d03df93388d8ee493927df149dd2f7906bec57",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aca9524e256df1c45d0d660",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会出现能够战胜眼前这名赛马娘的对手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e078cd56f4fd8bc369ec4b63e098827bb6c47d5cb1b0434776763a57642835e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "34202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d09d494f1457f74ac3e7e407",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的得力好手<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>再度于<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 中获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af5d39fd28f5a4fb6c3303022012c608e0144c6fe0a0700540581e1af505429d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae3f22560899fa7b760cfcf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赛况激荡的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中，<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>理所当然地拿下第1。",
      "source_fingerprint": "949045711e129c1626fb33934fa1627dd245ea1eac7948a41f0277d911fa65e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:118a63d06d205be5be273a87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在强者集结的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 上依旧没有大爆冷门。获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68efe6e8764c278b89be9c3283c27e93fadb8a86846cd8da23d5d9878c83aa4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b5624409709a83b7eeaa41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今的战绩为5战5胜，所向无敌的赛马娘再度获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39065383b9c9c2d91b1e5ac9f9ea1b0e4cc1a09ef7598d18b8ec50374bc97d8d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f5c3ad66d228537ea4621b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "众人都预测她会获胜，而她也没有违背众人的期待拿下了胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "908492f3e40d69e31646f07b64dc02b043d2ac5ed060318d934db4e8b9c565e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:043e93ad7ffc14625474949f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从起跑开始就展现足以震撼会场般疾风怒涛的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60ee69d22068f74bce979e15593bbe9f735b9ecdd5bf638ac5c4150ac65f2e5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b67d765e77251a4122501b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好强、好强、太强了。等不及想看她的下一场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6c1867cba8636a9b6fb32d66c64f8719a2ec3c794f01cb12163facd352ea09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07131e47d95c550a67f86308",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是打破以往认知的最强选手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06eed2119d357e71210a472106e905af54bdf45f58fd8c03d8af20bef59ad872",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f9da236d4e4c6df5c64b945",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为大赛的主角，想必连在决赛也会居高临下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a78cf47b7d876d9252bfc452e64b20cf8d84e9ef66dbd8576160ae3d4fb86b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "35202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d894f1cc4ac768e7b3d9479",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮，至今未尝败绩的<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>再度拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c915f239bd4b3d7fb5a042839b2090d5e38505b5a20b582c516edff1632b2071",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eef5886d58f3dd2f21a2f7c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不知败北为何物的<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>再度于<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮竞赛中拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bafefa7a4622dcbc635c22137b28fe27769035f8443b92d037955b2617e6cb48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8846fbe3ba9a743def8a9f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 的赛况难以预料，但依旧不动摇属于<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>的胜利。她再度拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1b1779cfaec98e3f587d5800793ee1423e608bcba6ab928ccd1103bce2c45e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0de991656bed1ca95104929",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她的精彩表现让我们在本次大赛中，很快就听见优胜候补的呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c3d7a604e738c32e379e8a03c8813a8e838fdf87e48fa86926a625d99b5236",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d570f4c7e7d05a777dc052bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽说她本次的参赛经验尚不丰富，但确实拥有在关键时刻取胜的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fffc72fcee71ae681061d59ef97773ebde04bf76d9b98f9b4f596f8f5e5dac6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9451d8d9edd2aa1e5f2c9c93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使受到周遭提防，她还是以精彩的表现上演了连胜剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87dcc25d4ce56776773be4c539dbe72c30339df159e0ff1a89190f470e90a053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8c4b65396e997406ab7a54b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她能够过关斩将直到何时呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cddb276b79959e8081523bcce08752ff336e65d5a9a30c537495eb9f8c1b77ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48fa1a9a2c65c66b9baeeffb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她能继续获胜到何时呢？其今后的表现也让人无比期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb524491486b3e4449dd2ae83053ec4c7ee1e5da2c6fd644913315e63f78c25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a44ba6614676bf001868050",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可别错过她在本次大赛之后的表现……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a1b35c2829026cc5ee47ce368849f75e3ce8f25d6b05feb434a69bdcd68932",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "7202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48afe3c7d4f01e4ffe11f93c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有在竞赛中发挥了如预期般的表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "466f1e8b4647557a653f4ec059f9ade227cedc05fe6330f92faf02fae4f28634",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1c746f0b3a99582673e5786",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是完美的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9ebc1cb9b30a3ca8351ef03e95728c2b002b37482da6ca46f097413db1ed117",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e729b1710594a6681ecf32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你对下场比赛的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c9b4b8c8e47c1aef791147f674ef58dcfc26a04b9160e5e31662ee54ae42d3c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85691325fb78a39b9c3aa520",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请针对竞赛发表感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb76c82153db35de63f5ca6025641ee3a49f5a21ddca6dfefa538ef26ab36fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af2b6d57904f9b6576046610",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜你获得优胜！你想将心情传达给谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfdf30222ae9eb9ea3232b2b5bd86509c8ec188449ddc544c363594864bc35e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21bf84ac501f8afa3aa61d62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天吃的致胜料理是什么呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a143f130fb1144b13793bb05c91f16e672a449dd6a02d80a8328f4bef6117304",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5f837acdf391bb57b904c19",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你是如何与队友相处的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bf33804c0ddbe15a57ff436052ec977cc84d0f93b5f13253fe2e6477124d229",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d78b9d6e700a9142064f75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你是以什么样的心情面对竞赛的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd3202703a25719cb74a8d7066db47cc31e7f974580080de2b17a42d699644e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ca83c5bb8b2429d515be782",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下一场竞赛的目标是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eabfa5daceafb749945f0e6223866ca440c057c50b1c17990b61d8b90193cd4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f8e732606df65cd2e401c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见在决赛会对上更强的对手喔……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2185cab6bfdf5885de6d8c935472abba933eb945b581846656f2e05d727dbb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50aa65b888e1bbda6af785a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你是以什么样的心情面对竞赛的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd3202703a25719cb74a8d7066db47cc31e7f974580080de2b17a42d699644e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b1c2056ac8e368d4be6199",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下一场竞赛的目标是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eabfa5daceafb749945f0e6223866ca440c057c50b1c17990b61d8b90193cd4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91375876d8b190a5e02f552b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见在决赛会对上更强的对手喔……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2185cab6bfdf5885de6d8c935472abba933eb945b581846656f2e05d727dbb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039d757e96a4e8255a02cad6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对手都比自己年长，会让你感到棘手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0766e886776a9cc9003e780e72151feabdfb250ed9544f2fab0cc840b729ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0424b6b163c75155fe26520e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你现在最真实的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25b10093c7bcd7bb0b33fb769fa1ff5dcbac111657f72044d5d3ad7cb49ca500",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12114a73b25788b34c1749ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "此刻，你想将什么样的心情传达给谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "650002252ed876d9b30b4ff19d140d07b4e279dd7bb2052090a582370fe2701f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d8f9f065e3d8f2d4fb83d33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你现在最真实的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25b10093c7bcd7bb0b33fb769fa1ff5dcbac111657f72044d5d3ad7cb49ca500",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e32b5fa2bfd63ed7251846e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "此刻，你想将什么样的心情传达给谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "650002252ed876d9b30b4ff19d140d07b4e279dd7bb2052090a582370fe2701f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
